From d25de2424e8808e871e732b42eedea28e498bd49 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seedds <seedds@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:29:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Odyssey HUD move / resize + full-screen UI (0113)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hook Pane::Calculate (main+0x909494, found by the HUDLOG diagnostic run
and confirmed by disassembly) with a rewriter cut at +0x13c: hud_calc
moves / resizes the four HUD panels (compass, life, coins, moons, matched
by pane name) by the gear menu's 'HUD 设置', and stretches the full-screen
layout roots (PauseMenu, WorldMap) to the screen shape -- a standard root
is widened / heightened to the layout, an oversized root is shrunk to fit.
The life panel has no locked pane name yet; its settings are stored but
match nothing until the name is locked from the V1.3.9 log. No runtime
__TEXT write (load-time rewriter cut, the duo_anchor pattern); the origin
byte (+0x5b) and the y-up, centred layout space are from the disassembly
of the local matrix helper.

Front-ends: the gear menu gains 'HUD 设置' (DmGamepad.m, GameMenu.swift);
the host gains dm_hud_set / dm_hud_frame_tick (hud.c, called once per
present from uw_frame_hook).
